gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "ANAHI: Sorry for the wait.\p"
	.string "Welcome to ARAUNA.\p"
	.string "My name is ANAHI.\p"
	.string "I am a field researcher.\p"
	.string "I study POKéMON, memory\n"
	.string "and BONDS.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is a POKéMON.\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "People and POKéMON live\n"
	.string "side by side across ARAUNA.\p"
	.string "We work, travel, and build\n"
	.string "BONDS with one another.\p"
	.string "But some of those BONDS\n"
	.string "are beginning to fail.\p"
	.string "POKéMON forget places, voices,\n"
	.string "and even who walked with them.\p"
	.string "We call this DISENCHANTMENT.\p"
	.string "I am trying to understand\n"
	.string "what is happening.\p"
	.string "Maybe your journey will find\n"
	.string "answers my laboratory could not.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you, who are you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "What is your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So you are {PLAYER}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "I understand.\p"
	.string "You are {PLAYER}, moving to\n"
	.string "VILA AMANHECER.\p"
	.string "Now it makes sense.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right. Are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your journey through ARAUNA\n"
	.string "starts now.\p"
	.string "Watch the POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Listen to the people.\p"
	.string "Memory is not ownerless data.\p"
	.string "When you reach VILA AMANHECER,\n"
	.string "find my laboratory.\p"
	.string "$"
